<title>FRANCE: Moroccan millers seek 20,000 tns Argentine wheat.</title>
<headline>Moroccan millers seek 20,000 tns Argentine wheat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan millers will tender on November 28 to import 20,000 tonnes of Argentine soft wheat for December 20-30 delivery, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>The tender will be held by the Association Professionnelle de la Minoterie, they said. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
